// What bars and shops sell (ProductType). Copied into the world when a scenario starts. The park sets one price per
// product (Finances menu → Prices; it starts at referencePriceCents, at most maxPriceCents). Guests compare the price with
// the reference: elasticityPermille is how much of the buy chance each reference price above it removes (1000: double
// price, no sales; cheaper adds up to +50 %); paying above the reference costs a little mood and lowers the value part of
// their review. goodsCostPermille: what one sale costs the park in goods.
// lunch: sat down for minMinutes..maxMinutes once per visit (bar seats).
// Others are impulse buys: impulsePermille per minute between laps at a bar (scaled up for a stop on the way to a trail,
// facilityRules.stopScalePermille), only by guests with less energy than whenEnergyBelow. Effects: energy and happiness
// (0..1000), alcohol (bolder trail choices and more crashes, wears off by the minute), caffeineMinutes (climbing costs
// half the energy meanwhile). overnight: a night at a campground (campers pay their nights on arrival; the price decides
// how many arriving guests camp). rental: a rental bike for the day (bike shop with a rental counter; the price decides
// how many guests without a bike come). clip: a video clip from a photo spot (a camera at a jump), bought after a filmed run.
// Bike shop departments (department: true, each takes a shelf slot, chosen per shop; merch: booked as merch): homeChancePermille
// is the chance a perfectly happy guest going home buys it, impulsePermille / rainImpulsePermille (only while it rains)
// between laps, once per visit each; groups: how much beginners / intermediates / experts like it (permille, 1000 = as
// is); byCard: paid by card, not from the cash the guest brought for the day (gear and bikes). protection: crashes of a guest wearing it are less often
// serious. withServicePermille: bought with a repair or service at the same shop (parts).
// Workshop (a workbench for minMinutes..maxMinutes): repair fixes a bike broken in a crash; services (serviceChancePermille,
// asked once per visit at the first stop near the shop, own bikes only): tuneUpPermille keeps that share of the
// bike-only crashes, redBlackFun is extra fun on red and black trails for the visit.
// Catalog order is the order guests consider things in.
